{"track":"r","category":"기초 문법","level":1,"title":"원의 넓이","desc":"<p>반지름이 <code>r</code>인 원의 넓이를 <b>소수 둘째 자리까지 반올림</b>해 돌려주는 <code>circle_area(r)</code>를 만드세요. 원주율은 R에 내장된 <code>pi</code>를 쓰세요.</p>","solution":"circle_area <- function(r) {\n  round(pi * r^2, 2)\n}\n","hint":"<p><code>round(값, 2)</code> 는 소수 둘째 자리까지 반올림해요.</p>","tests":[{"call":"circle_area(1)","expected":3.14,"visible":true},{"call":"circle_area(2)","expected":12.57,"visible":true},{"call":"circle_area(0)","expected":0,"visible":false},{"call":"circle_area(10)","expected":314.16,"visible":false},{"call":"circle_area(0.5)","expected":0.79,"visible":false}],"starter":"circle_area <- function(r) {\n  \n}\n","id":"r-302"}